ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120847","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120847.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120847.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-02T17:54:13Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWe had no AESContext tests\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI uses these test to confirm #120725 .\r\nAs a side note, this test allows for calling `AESContext::start`  with ECB mode and IV (which is not needed, and thus ignored).\r\n\r\nI'd advise, even if it's a breaking compat, to throw an error there, to avoid users inadvertently using ECB instead of CBC (which requires IV) due to failed autocomplete without even realizing it.\r\n\r\nThis PR also consolidate core crypto tests under `tests/core/crypto`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120847/timeline",